# ── Sensitive: production data exports ────────────────────────────────────
# Sheet dumps used by the GAS → Supabase migration. Contains PDPA-regulated
# user PII (names, phone numbers, addresses) and live admin keys.
# Never commit these.
scripts/migrate/.data/

# ── Local tooling state (machine-specific or regenerable) ─────────────────
# Claude Code settings — contains absolute paths from one machine.
.claude/

# Generated knowledge graph (~6MB). Rebuild with `graphify update .`
graphify-out/

# Supabase CLI local state. Note: supabase/migrations/ is intentionally NOT
# ignored — migration SQL must be tracked once the migration lands.
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/
CLAUDE.md

# ── Sensitive: Apps Script export ─────────────────────────────────────────
# GAS #3's source carries the live REGISTRATION_WEBHOOK_SECRET, the admin's
# LINE userId and spreadsheet ids. Kept locally as a reference for the one
# script still in the request path (lib/notify-registration.ts); not tracked.
google-apps-script/GAS3/
